  "body": "What is missing: the no-tilt law for the 3D Pocket open side is enforced only in the generator. It is not enforced when the command is created.\n\nEvidence: `TILTED_OPEN_SIDE` in `crates/app/src/operation/open_side.rs` refuses a tilted whole model at generation. The test `no_3d_pocket_kind_carries_a_tilt` pins that no kind carries a tilt today. AGENTS.md says to validate early and reject a malformed setup when the command is created.\n\nFound in the review of PR #1780. Related: #1774.\n\nDone means: the create and edit commands refuse a tilted whole-model 3D Pocket with the same named message. A test in `crates/app/tests/` pins the refusal at command creation. Undo leaves the document unchanged.\n",
